<title>SRI LANKA: S.Lanka '97 inflation to fall to 8-9 pct-cbank.</title>
<headline>S.Lanka '97 inflation to fall to 8-9 pct-cbank.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's Central Bank governor said on Friday he expected average annual inflation in 1997 to fall to between eight and nine percent from 15.9 last year.</p>
<p>&quot;The annual average should be around 8-9 percent,&quot; Amarananda Jayawardena told Reuters in an interview.</p>
</text>
